{"availability":"available","full":"arthur-ai/louisa","name":"louisa","description":"Meet Louisa. Automatic, AI-powered release notes for GitHub and GitLab. Push a tag → Louisa generates polished, user-facing changelogs using Claude. Zero dependencies. Setup in minutes.","category":"Productivity","language":"JavaScript","stars":6,"forks":3,"created":"2026-03-06T20:39:22Z","updated":"2026-10-12T08:35:34Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://louisa-five.vercel.app","topics":["ai","anthropic","automation","bot","changelog","ci-cd","claude","developer-experience","developer-tools","devops","github-actions","github-webhook","gitlab","llm","opentelemetry","productivity","release-automation","release-management","release-notes","vercel"],"demo":"https://louisa-five.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T00:57:30.885Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T00:57:30.885Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T00:57:30.885Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T11:46:00.223Z","stars":6,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-16T00:57:30.885Z","stars":6,"forks":3}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Automatic, AI-powered release notes for GitHub and GitLab — so your team never has to write them again.","Louisa is a lightweight serverless bot that listens for new tags and releases on your GitHub or GitLab repos, analyzes the commits and pull/merge requests since the last release, and uses Claude to generate polished, user-facing release notes — published directly to your Releases page.","She also enriches every merged PR and MR in place — rewriting vague titles and sparse descriptions into a consistent, structured format so that the context developers already captured gets properly surfaced when it's time to generate notes and content."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/arthur-ai/louisa/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ed8f4d37be55fa7667edc6d919f36e7eae9ddbf406851d062cd3d25ad766cd0f","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T06: